00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:17.650
Good morning!

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.350
Oh, Yasuna.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:22.840
Would you remember already?

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:25.110
