Kill Me Baby!

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:28.340
asobou yo wasa wasa

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:28.340
Let's play! Rustle! Rustle!

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:29.550
Kill Me Baby!

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:30.680
damatte naamin

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:30.680
Quiet, Naamin

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:31.930
Kill Me Baby!

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:33.180
doushitemo camo camo

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:33.180
Please! Come on! Come on!

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:34.390
Kill Me Baby!

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:35.850
urusai don!

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:35.850
